//       PLAYER_STATE_EXIT_VEHICLE (4)
//     FIX: reemplazado PLAYER_STATE_ENTER_VEHICLE por las 3 constantes
//     correctas (_DRIVER, _PASSENGER, EXIT_VEHICLE).
